---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Site title="Host your own Jeo" current="host">
	<div class="content-wrap host-page fx-rise">
		<header class="host-header">
			<h1>Host Your Own Mirror</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">Schools block domains quickly. Beat the filters by launching your own private mirror of Jeo in under 60 seconds.</p>
		</header>

		<div class="deploy-grid">
			<!-- Option 1: GitHub Pages -->
			<div class="deploy-card">
				<div class="deploy-card__icon github">
					<Icon name="package" size={24} />
				</div>
				<h3>GitHub Pages</h3>
				<p>Deploy directly to GitHub's free hosting with build actions built right in.</p>
				<ol class="steps-list">
					<li>Fork the <a href="https://github.com/Gotojeowebsite/jeoweb" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Jeoweb Repository</a>.</li>
					<li>Go to <strong>Settings &rarr; Pages</strong> on your fork.</li>
					<li>Set source to <strong>GitHub Actions</strong>.</li>
					<li>The next push automatically scans, builds, and publishes your site!</li>
				</ol>
				<a href="https://github.com/Gotojeowebsite/jeoweb/fork" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--secondary btn--full-w">
					<Icon name="external" size={14} /> Fork Repo
				</a>
			</div>

			<!-- Option 2: Vercel -->
			<div class="deploy-card">
				<div class="deploy-card__icon vercel">
					<Icon name="zap" size={24} />
				</div>
				<h3>Vercel Deployment</h3>
				<p>One-click cloning and lightning fast CDN hosting. Perfect for a clean personal link.</p>
				<p class="note">Automatically creates a new private repository on your GitHub account and links the build output.</p>
				<a href="https://vercel.com/new/clone?repository-url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FGotojeowebsite%2Fjeoweb" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--primary btn--full-w deploy-btn vercel-btn">
					<Icon name="play" size={14} /> Deploy to Vercel
				</a>
			</div>

			<!-- Option 3: Netlify -->
			<div class="deploy-card">
				<div class="deploy-card__icon netlify">
					<Icon name="sparkles" size={24} />
				</div>
				<h3>Netlify Host</h3>
				<p>Deploy your custom branch instantly. Supports customizable subdomains (e.g. <code>my-math-site.netlify.app</code>).</p>
				<p class="note">Provides an intuitive web panel to change site headers and customize access domains.</p>
				<a href="https://app.netlify.com/start/deploy?repository=https://github.com/Gotojeowebsite/jeoweb" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--primary btn--full-w deploy-btn netlify-btn">
					<Icon name="play" size={14} /> Deploy to Netlify
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<section class="host-section">
			<h2><Icon name="settings" size={20} /> How to Add Your Own Games</h2>
			<p>Once you have cloned the repository, adding custom files is incredibly simple:</p>
			<div class="code-box">
				<p>1. Drop a game folder into <code>Assets/&lt;slug&gt;/</code> containing your game files and an <code>index.html</code>.</p>
				<p>2. Add a cover image inside that folder (e.g. <code>logo.png</code> or <code>icon.jpg</code>).</p>
				<p>3. Run <code>npm run game:scan</code> or restart your local server. The scanner detects it and updates the listing automatically!</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</Site>

<style>
	.host-page {
		max-width: var(--max-w-content);
		padding-top: var(--space-7);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-8);
	}
	.host-header {
		text-align: center;
		max-width: var(--max-w-prose);
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	.host-header h1 {
		font-size: var(--text-display);
		font-weight: var(--weight-display);
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		background: var(--gradient-aurora);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
	}
	.subtitle {
		font-size: var(--text-h3);
		color: var(--fg-1);
		line-height: var(--leading-base);
	}
	
	.deploy-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
		gap: var(--space-5);
	}
	
	.deploy-card {
		background: var(--bg-1);
		border: 1px solid var(--line-1);
		border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
		padding: var(--space-6);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-4);
		transition: border-color var(--motion-fast), transform var(--motion-fast);
	}
	.deploy-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--line-2);
		transform: translateY(-4px);
	}
	
	.deploy-card__icon {
		width: 48px;
		height: 48px;
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}
	.deploy-card__icon.github { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); color: var(--fg-0); }
	.deploy-card__icon.vercel { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); color: var(--fg-0); }
	.deploy-card__icon.netlify { background: rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.15); color: var(--semantic-webgl); }
	
	.deploy-card h3 {
		font-size: var(--text-h2);
		font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
	}
	.deploy-card p {
		font-size: var(--text-body);
		color: var(--fg-1);
		line-height: var(--leading-base);
	}
	.deploy-card .note {
		font-size: var(--text-xs);
		color: var(--fg-2);
	}
	
	.steps-list {
		padding-left: var(--space-4);
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-2);
	}
	.steps-list li {
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--fg-1);
		line-height: var(--leading-snug);
	}
	.steps-list a {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
	
	.btn--full-w {
		width: 100%;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-top: auto;
	}
	
	.vercel-btn {
		background: #ffffff !important;
		color: #000000 !important;
		border: 1px solid #ffffff !important;
	}
	.vercel-btn:hover {
		background: #eaeaea !important;
	}
	
	.netlify-btn {
		background: var(--semantic-webgl) !important;
		color: #000000 !important;
		border: 1px solid var(--semantic-webgl) !important;
	}
	.netlify-btn:hover {
		opacity: 0.9;
	}
	
	.host-section {
		background: var(--bg-1);
		border: 1px solid var(--line-1);
		border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
		padding: var(--space-6);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-4);
	}
	.host-section h2 {
		font-size: var(--text-h2);
		font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-2);
	}
	.host-section p {
		font-size: var(--text-body);
		color: var(--fg-1);
	}
	
	.code-box {
		background: var(--bg-0);
		border: 1px solid var(--line-0);
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		padding: var(--space-4);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-2);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--fg-1);
	}
</style>
